	(text_box "ESP32C5 HARDWARE CONSIDERATIONS:\n- The C5 does not have a USB connector\n  - Programming is to be done through JTAG pins\n  - To enable programming through the JTAG pins eFuse 2: EFUSE_DIS_USB_JTAG has to be set to 1 (default 0)\n- BOOT CONFIGURATION\n  - GPIO26_BOOT is pulled to GND (for all boot configurations) \n  - GPIO27_BOOT and GPIO28_BOOT have PU R with a pull-down BTN\n  - Solder bridge allows for either both to be pulled LOW or only the GPIO28_BOOT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
