	(text_box "PROJECT REQUIREMENTS/GOALS:\n- Camera OV5647 to capture real-time vide (or smiliar)\n- Provide WIFI link (to transmit the real-time video)\n- Control motor through CAN-FD interface\n- High Speed 8-bit pparallel connection to expansion PCBs\n- High Speed USB connector\n- I2C, UART, SPI (through FPC) interfaces\n\nSECONDARY GOALS:\n- Function as a simple server\n- Motor control through PWM pins\n- LCD with touch screen (MIPI 2LANE)\n"
